  "requirements": [
    "Resolve module-scoped display object by stable original object name Show Text; resolve feature Content/FontSize when requested.",
    "Typed object-property reads/writes for Feature.Value, Object.okcolor/ngcolor/opacity; these are not execution parameter CurValue writes.",
    "BridgeItemBase resolves object lazily on first getter, caches object; native GetParamUnit/SetParamUnit are no-ops.",
    "Notify property edits to shared display object, persistence and preview without rerunning algorithm, preserve object lifetime across ordinary window reopen.",
    "StringConfig placeholder insertion uses typed front-and-self int/float/string tree and current caret brace location; do not parse displayed labels into identity.",
    "Explicit unsupported for missing object/property/type or feature insertion rules; never reflect arbitrary CLR property names from untrusted XML."
  ],
